#: rust/rexon-core/src/qt_steam.rs
msgid ""
"A video at login is a Steam Deck signature. Rexon brings it to your regular "
"computer: Valve's built-in startup movies and the ones you've already bought "
"in the Points Shop — with full sound and without the desktop flashing "
"through."
