msgstr "AeroThemePlasma снова на месте"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid ""
"AeroThemePlasma fits Plasma again, so Rexon brought back your saved look and "
"panels."
msgstr ""
"AeroThemePlasma снова подходит к Plasma, и Rexon вернул ваш сохранённый вид "
"и панели."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
