msgstr "Элегантный рабочий стол от Buddies of Budgie"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "The calm, macOS-like desktop of elementary OS"
msgstr "Спокойный рабочий стол elementary OS в духе macOS"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid ""
"The polished desktop of deepin with rounded, translucent windows, on its own "
