msgstr "Ошибка сброса Plymouth"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Plymouth is already on the default theme “%1”"
msgstr "Plymouth уже на стандартной теме «%1»"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a theme name; “%1.plymouth” is its file name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
