msgid "If you don't use it, remove the package: %1"
msgstr "Если вы им не пользуетесь, удалите пакет: %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: Explains why the package kwin-x11 left the repositories. "Plasma (X11)" is a session name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "The Plasma (X11) session is not supported on this version of Plasma."
msgstr "Сеанс Plasma (X11) в этой версии Plasma не поддерживается."

#. TRANSLATORS: About a package that no longer gets updates; the window has a button to remove it.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "If you don't use it, Rexon can remove it."
msgstr "Если вы им не пользуетесь, Rexon может его удалить."

#. TRANSLATORS: In a desktop notification about a package that no longer gets updates.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "If you don't use it, open Rexon to remove it."
msgstr "Если вы им не пользуетесь, откройте Rexon, чтобы удалить его."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 and %2 are session names as shown on the login screen, e.g. "Plasma (X11)" and "Plasma (Wayland)".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"You are using %1 right now, and it runs on this package. Sign in to %2 and "
"remove it from there."
msgstr ""
"Вы сейчас в сеансе %1, он работает на этом пакете. Войдите в сеанс %2 и "
"удалите его оттуда."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 and %2 are session names as shown on the login screen, e.g. "Plasma (X11)" and "Plasma (Wayland)".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"The login screen starts %1 by itself, and it runs on this package. Sign in "
"to %2 once, so the login screen remembers it, and remove the package from "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Экран входа сам открывает сеанс %1, а он работает на этом пакете. Один раз "
"войдите в сеанс %2, чтобы экран входа его запомнил, и удалите пакет оттуда."

#. TRANSLATORS: Said after the login screen was switched to another session; the package is the one Rexon offered to remove.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Now the package can be removed."
msgstr "Теперь пакет можно удалить."

#. TRANSLATORS: Button. %1 is a package name (or several, comma-separated), e.g. "kwin-x11".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Remove %1"
msgstr "Удалить %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: Result of removing packages. %1 is a package name (or several).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Removed: %1."
msgstr "Удалено: %1."

#. TRANSLATORS: Follows "Removed: <package>." after Rexon checked the packages again.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Everything else is in order."
msgstr "Остальное в порядке."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a package name (or several).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Rexon couldn't remove %1."
msgstr "Rexon не смог удалить %1."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a package with its new version (e.g. "gdk-pixbuf2 2.44.8"),
#. %2 a package it needs, %3 the version of %2 that stays installed,
#. %4 the newer version of %2 that already exists in another repository.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"The update would install %1, but %2, which it needs, would stay at version "
"%3: the repository your system prefers doesn't have version %4 yet."
msgstr ""
"Обновление поставит %1, а нужный ему %2 останется версии %3: в репозитории, "
"который ваша система смотрит первым, версии %4 ещё нет."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME),
#. %2 packages with versions, e.g. "qt6-base 6.12.0 with qt6-declarative 6.11.2".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "The update would install parts of %1 of different versions (%2)."
msgstr "Обновление поставит части %1 разных версий (%2)."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME),
#. %2 packages with versions, e.g. "qt6-base 6.12.0 with qt6-declarative 6.11.2".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "The last update installed parts of %1 of different versions (%2)."
msgstr "Последнее обновление поставило части %1 разных версий (%2)."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME),
