#. TRANSLATORS: Result. %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid ""
"The previous versions of %1 are back. Restarting the computer is safe again."
msgstr "Прежние версии %1 возвращены. Перезагружать компьютер снова безопасно."

#. TRANSLATORS: Result. %1 is a product name (Qt, Plasma, KDE Frameworks, GNOME).
