"Live wallpapers on %1 need the Rexon shell extension: it's installed "
"together with the program — turn it on in “%2” and try again."
msgstr ""
"Для живых обоев на %1 нужно расширение оболочки Rexon: оно ставится вместе с "
"программой, включите его в «%2» и повторите."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the place in Rexon, e.g. “Appearance → GNOME Extensions”.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The Rexon shell extension is left over from an older version and doesn't "
"know how to start the wallpaper. Reinstall it in “%1” and try again."
msgstr ""
"Расширение оболочки Rexon осталось от прежней версии и не понимает, чем "
"запускать обои. Переустановите его в «%1» и повторите."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The wallpaper was handed to the shell extension, but the extension itself is "
"turned off — turn on “Rexon Wallpaper Engine” in the extension list."
msgstr ""
"Обои переданы расширению оболочки, но само расширение выключено — включите "
"«Rexon Wallpaper Engine» в списке расширений."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"There's nothing to show live wallpapers with: the rexon-wallpaper-host "
"program wasn't found. It's installed together with Rexon — reinstall Rexon. "
