"Theme recovery currently works only on KDE Plasma.\n"
"You are running: %1. Nothing was changed.\n"
"\n"
"On this desktop, restore the look in the desktop's own settings or on the "
"Appearance tab."
msgstr ""
"Восстановление темы пока умеет только KDE Plasma.\n"
