"itself — the panel, the password prompt, window management. As long as they "
"are installed, <b>resetting the theme will not remove them</b>. To get "
"standard Plasma back, they have to be removed and the standard packages "
"reinstalled."
msgstr ""
"Установлены пакеты <b>AeroThemePlasma / AeroShell</b>:<br><br>%1<br><br>Это "
